                                                "sense_id": "5cdd4c9d-2c13-32c9-9605-d8860913221a",
                                                "text": "This chapter focuses on the pricing of various exotic interest rate derivatives including Bermudan swaptions, constant maturity swaps, trigger swaps, index amortizing swaps, and quantos."
